markedit-comments

The on-disk comment format and the code under src/format/ (types, escaping,
id generation, parsing, serialization and the pure edit operations) are ported
from the Obsidian "Document Comments" plugin:

  https://github.com/kylemcd/obsidian-document-comments
  Copyright (c) 2026 Kyle McDonald
  Licensed under the MIT License

The port keeps the format byte-compatible so files can be read and written by
both tools and by agents using the plugin's published format reference.
